                "text": "&lt;div class=&quot;voiceNote&quot; data-voice=&quot;3&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;voiceName&quot;&gt;Folklorist&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;“Big fish eat little fish” was already a proverb in antiquity. Bruegel also made it the subject of a drawing of its own.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;"
            }
