            "frametrail:name": "In Dutch, to hang the blue cloak on someone meant to cheat o",
            "frametrail:attributes": {
                "text": "&lt;div class=&quot;voiceNote&quot; data-voice=&quot;3&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;voiceName&quot;&gt;Folklorist&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;In Dutch, to hang the blue cloak on someone meant to cheat on them. Blue stood for deceit and for folly.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;"
